<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:39:27 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>用 Unreal Engine 把 Anyma 的 Coachella 演出扩展为广播 AR</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine</link><description>Anyma 的 Coachella 现场借助 Unreal Engine、MetaHuman 与广播 AR 技术，把音乐视觉体验带给了线上观众。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">337da5318251a6bfe1b582440f1fa57277a240c1</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>新一波单人 AI 游戏制作者赚到钱了吗？并没有</title><link>https://mobilegamer.biz/are-the-new-wave-of-solo-ai-game-makers-making-any-money-no-not-really</link><description>用 Claude Code 等 AI 工具做的游戏正涌入应用商店，但真正赚到钱或获得下载量的寥寥无几，单人 AI 开发的变现现实远比热度冷清。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:19:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e17dc5b4c9c27b40eaf0fe5ec13cc3beff8d9cd5</guid><source url="https://mobilegamer.biz/are-the-new-wave-of-solo-ai-game-makers-making-any-money-no-not-really">MobileGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>用 UE5 还原《Bluey》标志性 2D 画风：Gameloft Brisbane 的开发访谈</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/developer-interviews/say-cheese-recreating-an-iconic-2d-art-style-with-ue5-in-blueys-happy-snaps</link><description>Gameloft Brisbane 团队分享如何用 Unreal Engine 5 的动画工具，把热门儿童动画《Bluey》的 2D 世界搬进 3D 游戏。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b5f0043cd5b8425b97593ce35c3a133329a61b70</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/developer-interviews/say-cheese-recreating-an-iconic-2d-art-style-with-ue5-in-blueys-happy-snaps">Unreal Engine 博客</s