rboai/how-to-make-a-game-with-ai-from-the-idea-to-your-phone-4n0e">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Sensor Tower：GTA 6 预购额超 14 亿美元，87% 来自终极版</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-gta-6-pre-orders-exceed-14bn-with-87-for-the-ultimate-edition</link><description>预购数据透露了玩家对高价版本的接受度，值得关注 3A 大作的定价策略与版本分层。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">834fa9ad8d3bea420b598799b0d706ddfa44e302</guid><source url="https://www.gamesindustry.biz/sensor-tower-gta-6-pre-orders-exceed-14bn-with-87-for-the-ultimate-edition">GamesIndustry.biz</source></item><item><title>62 款微型浏览器游戏还在涨：Pop Recall 的每日发版日志</title><link>https://dev.to/poprecallgames/62-tiny-browser-games-and-counting-pop-recalls-daily-shipping-log-223</link><description>Pop Recall 四天前以 25 款纯原生 JavaScript 微型浏览器游戏上线，如今已涨到 62 款仍在每日更新；每款新游戏都要过同一套发版关卡——能通关、适配手机、暂停真正锁输入，上线后还要实测。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:02:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bb9bea4dc38062e2a06ca03a97e91d08a3a23e97</guid><source url="https://dev.to/poprecallgames/62-tiny-browser-games-and-counting-pop-recalls-daily-shipping-log-223">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 HTML5 Canvas 与 WebSockets 打造实时多人棋盘游戏引擎：Ludo Classic 架构解析</title><link>https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4</link><description>作者拆解一款实时多人棋盘游戏的引擎架构，讲 Canvas 渲染与 WebSocket 同步如何支撑回合制对局。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:36:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">88e75b91ad9b7b716d17c88b0da6dd320118eb68</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了一个 AI 助手，能用一句话聊天指令改 Unreal Engine 蓝图</title><link>https://dev.to/dola_ai_pro/i-built-an-ai-agent-that-edits-unreal-engine-blueprints-from-a-chat-prompt-3d4d</link><description>独立开发者花一年做的 Dola AI 嵌进 UE5 编辑器里，用自然语言描述需求就能让多